  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "32463322",
      "title": "Starting Setup & Why We Want Standalone Components",
      "lectureOrder": 664,
      "videoOrder": 611,
      "sourceHash": "4a6f4a99a3d4610aacda765d347ca4cae44740f5b1dbe6270dae536730045f7f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 4.29,
          "en": "Speaker: Now to understand what exactly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.29,
          "end": 6.78,
          "en": "standalone components are and which problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.78,
          "end": 10.62,
          "en": "is solved by them, I prepared a basic demo project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.62,
          "end": 13.68,
          "en": "which you find attached to this video.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.68,
          "end": 16.44,
          "en": "Now, this is a standard angular project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.44,
          "end": 18.87,
          "en": "nothing spectacular about it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.87,
          "end": 21.63,
          "en": "What's important though is that this project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.63,
          "end": 25.26,
          "en": "uses Angular Version 14 or higher.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.26,
          "end": 28.44,
          "en": "What I teach you will also work with higher versions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.44,
          "end": 30.27,
          "en": "Here I'm using the release candidate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.27,
          "end": 33.249,
          "en": "because I'm recording this before version 14",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.249,
          "end": 35.07,
          "en": "stable was released.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.07,
          "end": 37.41,
          "en": "But of course everything I explain is true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.41,
          "end": 39.69,
          "en": "for the stable version as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.69,
          "end": 41.46,
          "en": "I also again wanna emphasize",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.46,
          "end": 43.83,
          "en": "that this is not the only way of building Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.83,
          "end": 45.72,
          "en": "Instead it's a preview feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.72,
          "end": 48.75,
          "en": "So you should use engine modules, you should",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.75,
          "end": 51.84,
          "en": "use everything I taught you in my complete guide course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.84,
          "end": 54.27,
          "en": "This might become the future of Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.27,
          "end": 56.46,
          "en": "though maybe some details will change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.46,
          "end": 58.62,
          "en": "We'll see in the future.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 58.62,
          "end": 61.44,
          "en": "But what exactly are standalone components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 61.44,
          "end": 64.08,
          "en": "and which problem is solved by them?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 64.08,
          "end": 68.01,
          "en": "Well, for this, let's take a look at this demo application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.01,
          "end": 70.5,
          "en": "It is a very simple application in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.5,
          "end": 72.57,
          "en": "but it does have a couple of components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 72.57,
          "end": 74.43,
          "en": "It does have a custom directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.43,
          "end": 77.52,
          "en": "and a service and a shared module where I make this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 77.52,
          "end": 80.43,
          "en": "directive available to all other modules",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 80.43,
          "end": 82.17,
          "en": "that are interested.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.17,
          "end": 86.01,
          "en": "I got my app module where I'm declaring various components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 86.01,
          "end": 88.17,
          "en": "where I'm importing the shared module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.17,
          "end": 91.59,
          "en": "so that these components can use the directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 91.59,
          "end": 95.22,
          "en": "exported and declared in that shared module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.22,
          "end": 97.426,
          "en": "And then in those components, which I have,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 97.426,
          "end": 100.44,
          "en": "I'm using the other components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.44,
          "end": 103.11,
          "en": "So in the app component, I'm using the welcome component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 103.11,
          "end": 105.96000000000001,
          "en": "In the welcome component, I'm using the details component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 105.96000000000001,
          "end": 107.52000000000001,
          "en": "and in the details component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 107.52000000000001,
          "end": 110.55,
          "en": "I'm using my custom directive and I'm also using my",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 110.55,
          "end": 115.5,
          "en": "service and if you would install all the dependencies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 115.5,
          "end": 118.89,
          "en": "with npm install and you then would start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 118.89,
          "end": 121.77,
          "en": "the development server with ng serve",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 121.77,
          "end": 125.67,
          "en": "then you would get an application that looks like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.67,
          "end": 129.24,
          "en": "And please note that the navigation won't work yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 129.24,
          "end": 132.48,
          "en": "We'll add routing in a couple of minutes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.48,
          "end": 135.36,
          "en": "But then if you open the console, you'll also note that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.36,
          "end": 137.79,
          "en": "if you click on this area here at the bottom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 137.79,
          "end": 141.12,
          "en": "those clicks are registered because of our service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 141.12,
          "end": 144.09,
          "en": "You see the custom directive in action here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 144.09,
          "end": 147.09,
          "en": "It highlights this lost paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 147.09,
          "end": 150.93,
          "en": "and it is a standard Angular app therefore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 150.93,
          "end": 154.56,
          "en": "However, standard apps like this and all Angular apps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 154.56,
          "end": 157.74,
          "en": "in the end can have one problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 157.74,
          "end": 160.71,
          "en": "There is quite a lot of boiler plate code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 160.71,
          "end": 161.85,
          "en": "you have to write.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 161.85,
          "end": 165.09,
          "en": "You specifically have to add all these modules",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 165.09,
          "end": 167.67000000000002,
          "en": "like the app module or the shared module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 167.67000000000002,
          "end": 170.82,
          "en": "to organize and declare your directives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 170.82,
          "end": 175.82,
          "en": "and components to import and export modules into each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.95,
          "end": 180.95,
          "en": "And whilst this is not really difficult, it can be annoying.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.68,
          "end": 184.05,
          "en": "It's a lot of boiler plate code you have to write.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 184.05,
          "end": 185.58,
          "en": "It's a lot of extra work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 185.58,
          "end": 188.73,
          "en": "and it can make refactoring rather difficult.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 188.73,
          "end": 191.43,
          "en": "And it's of course not something you have to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 191.43,
          "end": 194.973,
          "en": "in other libraries or frameworks like React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 196.11,
          "end": 199.32,
          "en": "Now, Angular needs those modules internally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 199.32,
          "end": 201.96,
          "en": "It needs to know which components are available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 201.96,
          "end": 204.06,
          "en": "in whichever component and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 204.06,
          "end": 205.89,
          "en": "And that's why this feature exists.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 205.89,
          "end": 209.1,
          "en": "It's not there to make your life more difficult.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 209.1,
          "end": 212.64,
          "en": "Instead it's needed internally by Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 212.64,
          "end": 215.55,
          "en": "Nonetheless, it would be nice if we could get rid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 215.55,
          "end": 218.88,
          "en": "of these ng modules, and it turns out that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 218.88,
          "end": 222.423,
          "en": "this is exactly what standalone components will achieve.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 223.29,
          "end": 227.7,
          "en": "The Angular team worked hard to build a way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 227.7,
          "end": 230.64,
          "en": "of using Angular that allows us to get rid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 230.64,
          "end": 234.32999999999998,
          "en": "of ng modules to use standalone components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 234.32999999999998,
          "end": 235.961,
          "en": "and standalone directives instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 235.961,
          "end": 239.91,
          "en": "which don't need to be declared in the module module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 239.91,
          "end": 243.42,
          "en": "And the best part is that this new mode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 243.42,
          "end": 247.89,
          "en": "which is a preview right now, can be mixed with the old way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 247.89,
          "end": 250.8,
          "en": "or the current way of building Angular apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 250.8,
          "end": 253.44,
          "en": "So you can mix standalone components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 253.44,
          "end": 256.35,
          "en": "and directives and so on with ng modules",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 256.35,
          "end": 258.99,
          "en": "as you will see over the next minutes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 258.99,
          "end": 259.92,
          "en": "So that's the problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 259.92,
          "end": 263.13,
          "en": "We have this boiler plate code and we wanna get rid of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 263.13,
          "end": 267.42,
          "en": "How can we now use those standalone components though?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 267.42,
          "end": 272.07,
          "en": "Well, let's build our first standalone component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 272.07,
          "end": 274.8,
          "en": "at the example of the details component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 274.8,
          "end": 277.62,
          "en": "This is a regular component which is declared",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 277.62,
          "end": 278.97,
          "en": "in the app module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 278.97,
          "end": 282.48,
          "en": "Now we wanna convert it to a standalone component so",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 282.48,
          "end": 285.963,
          "en": "that we can see how we can build such standalone components.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
